{"id":387,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>2026年6月17日下午，经济与管理学院特邀太原理工大学经济与管理学院副院长、山西省学术技术带头人，三晋英才（拔尖骨干人才）陈怀超教授，在经济与管理学院院楼301开展主题为《学术论文写作与研究方法分享》的华彩讲坛。本次讲坛2024级与2025级硕士研究生参与，科研副院长张克勇教授主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KozWO7nzNPUmT7nxR62LN-4nmGZU8lJinzVfo7l8L7-4LNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyPLYyDLYh2Lzv8UlVfMRlsUzMVMNUZM4V2n7-ZLRNZMlnFLmWRUlUZL8QFnlU8nR9Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8L4GbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.png\" vurl=\"/_vsl/91363F174AAA457A3E6D871FDB80985D/22CAD83F/ED4D8\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 424px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KUN7OZnN7YMmviUx4LsM7CYollZLmUJ4UzMRUl-iMzGbUmv0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYLkyYUYhRMzMRMl-inlW7L7CPLzAkLm9bM8linzfRM7nFMlMknN7YU4QFL47YMln2gjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMRLaoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.png\"></p><p>讲座中，陈怀超教授结合自身多年学术写作与审稿经验，系统梳理了学术论文的主要类型及各部分写作逻辑。他从学术思维培养、论文选题来源、文献检索与高效阅读，到论文结构搭建与实证研究撰写，层层递进，为同学们呈现了一条清晰的学术写作路径。同时，陈教授还重点分享了当前备受关注的QCA（定性比较分析）和机器学习等前沿研究方法，拓宽了同学们的研究视野。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KLNLOYnl-ZUzT2LxzLYU8VfUzlbLz7JaLmWVM8CbnmC8UlL0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyDoSy8n1ysozfRM4rfUl74oRT7Mm6fnzLaUmLDM498MlWFnN-iLRf7MzTFM7UYoR7Jqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8L4GbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4694F790C75AAA389D67AE30B367845B/FB500D59/4D281\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 423px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KMNCOiUl7ZUmCYnxRlsnz-PnmLbM8rJfLN7iL4LZMm94MlL0gihFp2hmCIa0MShfU1hknSh2M4GDozWVnmnVUmUbMz6RL7nkL7CsUlQVMNMFL8UaoRW2ozTFL8UZU4MfgtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMRLaoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.jpg\"></p><p>现场气氛热烈，同学们纷纷表示，讲座内容既有理论高度，又贴近实际写作需求，尤其在研究设计和方法选择方面带来了深刻启发，令大家受益匪浅。此次讲坛不仅提升了研究生的学术写作能力，也为学院营造了浓厚的科研氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KMzAO7M4NioRfVLxzCiLlWfU8CbUl-JbMRNPMzVfn7UYMR90gihFp2hmCIa0MYhknkhknShRo7UiUmGDnRf7Lllsnz-4U4Q2UzNbLzrfoR6FM4AVLRG8M8rFMllaLRCJqjfjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8L4GbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7BDBEC8D5B06D0D1E7E23C6FA9915A87/78E0047E/5E006\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 411px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KM7LObn7n2MzMRMxNlaozviL49ao7QJVnmQ2LmUbM8UZLNC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysMYhRoSybU8UDMRlZM7LPLNLsLRrVnlrfnlVfMmW7U8MFnmr2UlrfL7QFL4AknlU4gtXaQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4LYyYMRLaoSbw6208c&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=KozWO7nzNPUmT7nxR62LN-4nmGZU8lJinzVfo7l8L7-4LNl0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyPLYyDLYh2Lzv8UlVfMRlsUzMVMNUZM4V2n7-ZLRNZMlnFLmWRUlUZL8QFnlU8nR9Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRL4g4-8L4GbgtA8pU0cc&oid=1280026481&tid=1033&nid=24309&e=.png"}